<%# UOFL OVERRIDE: UofL Theme - notice on the signed-in preview pages when a
    curator-edited uofl_*.yml file can't be read (missing, or a YAML
    mistake). The public pages quietly fall back to defaults in that case
    (see UoflYamlConfig), so this is where a curator finds out their edit
    didn't take. `errors` is a Hash of label => message (nil = file OK). %>
<% errors = errors.compact %>
<% if errors.any? %>
  <div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">
    <p><strong>A config file couldn't be read, so the live site is using defaults for it until it's fixed:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <% errors.each do |label, message| %>
        <li><strong><%= label %>:</strong> <code><%= message %></code></li>
      <% end %>
    </ul>
  </div>
<% end %>
